  <item>
    <title>E41 我们的有知有行</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6289e71d5cf4a5ad60ca0903</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6289e71d5cf4a5ad60ca0903</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 May 2022 07:32:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>感谢朝珺的邀请，和国庆一起聊了这个话题，也欢迎大家关注两位的播客节目《知因果》。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在我看来有知有行远不止一款产品，一家公司，更是一个生活方式和一种精神。</span></p><span></span><p><span>她关于真诚、善良、理性、自我实现；</span></p><span></span><p><span>她相信价值，相信美好的事会发生，相信更好的自己会对生活更有掌控，会有更好的投资、关系、事业和未来。</span></p><span></span><p><span>一起同行，与有荣焉。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Shownotes：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">01:55</a> &nbsp;我们是怎么遇见有知有行的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="400">06:40</a> &nbsp;我们会怎么跟朋友聊起有知有行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="675">11:15</a> &nbsp;为什么会向朋友介绍有知有行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1030">17:10</a> &nbsp;有知有行带给了我们什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1745">29:05</a> &nbsp;有知有行看上去很美，内部真的如此吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2975">49:35</a> &nbsp;当大量用户进入后，社区文化和氛围会如何变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3196">53:16</a> &nbsp;「有知有行」四个字的背后</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3500">58:20</a> &nbsp;跟投一个策略的三重境界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3710">61:50</a> &nbsp;有知有行是否过于依赖个人品牌？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3990">66:30</a> &nbsp;个人品牌可能会成为社区成长的天花板</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4109">68:29</a> &nbsp;一个小故事：薛定谔的公众号关注</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4926">82:06</a> &nbsp;个人和个人品牌如何可以走得更远</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5010">83:30</a> &nbsp;人很复杂，人会变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5436">90:36</a> &nbsp;对有知有行这家公司或者同事想说的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5755">95:55</a> &nbsp;用十年的眼光看当下</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsQZVNzeshG4xsxjVmFLjKU0Gtq9.m4a" length="97466994" type="audio/mp4"/>
